", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 5791, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 5717, "source_character_end": 3629, "source_character_start": 3561, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "table-source-and-current-price-multiples-note", "image_path": "images/page-1.png", "image_sha256": "c2835fe96465a4e9229425ed6549f7455c380982acb3bf673e091a6003774afc", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 7836, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 7567, "page_character_end": 5296, "page_character_start": 5149, "pdf_physical_page": 1, "printed_page": 1, "quote": "出所：会社データ、アストリス・アドバイザリー（推定）                                             E メール: Corporateresearch@astrisadvisory.com\n注：バリュエーション指標は全て直近の株価を用いて算出しています。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 7836, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 7567, "source_character_end": 5296, "source_character_start": 5149, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-market-valuation-statement", "image_path": "images/page-1.png", "image_sha256": "c2835fe96465a4e9229425ed6549f7455c380982acb3bf673e091a6003774afc", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 4964, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 4679, "page_character_end": 3040, "page_character_start": 2883, "pdf_physical_page": 1, "printed_page": 1, "quote": "• バリュエーション — アストリスの業績予想に基づく 2027 年 1 月期予                               ブルームバーグ 買い│ホールド│売り                        0│0│0\n  想 PER は 5.2 倍、PBR は 1.6 倍の水準で推移している。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 4964, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 4679, "source_character_end": 3040, "source_character_start": 2883, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "company-guidance-revision-as-reported", "image_path": "images/page-4.png", "image_sha256": "dc5aa5440d8959150a6d33156d0ea9b82a067c46736938b52c47240986027add", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 2268, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 1918, "page_character_end": 1196, "page_character_start": 1020, "pdf_physical_page": 4, "printed_page": 4, "quote": "2026 年 9 月 10 日、アールプランナーは FY1/27 会社予想を今期初めて上方修正し、売\n              上高を 565 億円（従来予想比+3.7%）、営業利益を 50 億円（同+23.5%）、当期純利益を\n              32.5 億円（同+22.6%）へと引き上げた。年間配当も 10 円増額の 55 円とした。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 18724, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 18374, "source_character_end": 11802, "source_character_start": 11626, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "issuer-table-heading", "image_path": "images/page-4.png", "image_sha256": "dc5aa5440d8959150a6d33156d0ea9b82a067c46736938b52c47240986027add", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 3542, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 3219, "page_character_end": 1848, "page_character_start": 1625, "pdf_physical_page": 4, "printed_page": 4, "quote": "FY1/27 修正後の会社予想と下期予想\n               (10 億円)          当初  修正後          修正率      上期実           進捗率             下期       下期前\n                              会社予想 会社予想           (％)       績            (％)            予想      年比(％)", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 19998, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 19675, "source_character_end": 12454, "source_character_start": 12231, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "issuer-table-EPS-row-yen", "image_path": "images/page-4.png", "image_sha256": "dc5aa5440d8959150a6d33156d0ea9b82a067c46736938b52c47240986027add", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 4411, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 4315, "page_character_end": 2627, "page_character_start": 2537, "pdf_physical_page": 4, "printed_page": 4, "quote": "EPS（円）          248.30   304.27    +22.5    156.52          51.4       147.75        +17.9", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 20867, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 20771, "source_character_end": 13233, "source_character_start": 13143, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "company-table-DPS-split-scope", "image_path": "images/page-4.png", "image_sha256": "dc5aa5440d8959150a6d33156d0ea9b82a067c46736938b52c47240986027add", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 4981, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 4658, "page_character_end": 2967, "page_character_start": 2838, "pdf_physical_page": 4, "printed_page": 4, "quote": "注：下期予想は修正後の会社予想から上期実績を差し引いた値。下期の前年比は、FY1/26 実績から FY1/26 上期実績を差し引いた\n              値との比較。1 株当たり配当の比較は株式分割調整後。出所：会社データ、アストリス・アドバイザリー", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 21437, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 21114, "source_character_end": 13573, "source_character_start": 13444, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "peer-comparison-trading-discount", "image_path": "images/page-7.png", "image_sha256": "94f59cf9bf080d0daca9135584bb290a728fd19f2dc394ac15d1b67d6a67f01b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 401, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 88, "page_character_end": 159, "page_character_start": 46, "pdf_physical_page": 7, "printed_page": 7, "quote": "アールプランナーは、FY1/26 の力強い利益成長と小型株の住宅メーカー同業他社の弱い業績見通しを背景に、PER ベースで国内同業他社に対し\nディスカウントで取引されている\n主要な収益性・バリュエーション指標の同業他社比較分析", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 26303, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 25990, "source_character_end": 16927, "source_character_start": 16814, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-revision-and-operating-assumptions", "image_path": "images/page-8.png", "image_sha256": "4970438a2591260df14f18732c8daec14179bfcac9c53a196e0411cee1a4934b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 643, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 159, "page_character_end": 309, "page_character_start": 89, "pdf_physical_page": 8, "printed_page": 8, "quote": "FY1/27 第 2 四半期決算および会社予想の修正を受け、当社は業績予想を引き上げる。\n\n                 •       当社の業績予想は、修正後の会社予想および開示された事業動向と整合的な注\n                         文住宅・分譲住宅の販売棟数の伸び、上期並みの売上総利益率、ならびに販管\n                         費の効率化による営業レバレッジの持続を前提としている。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 31004, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 30520, "source_character_end": 20782, "source_character_start": 20562, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-excluded-macro-and-MA", "image_path": "images/page-8.png", "image_sha256": "4970438a2591260df14f18732c8daec14179bfcac9c53a196e0411cee1a4934b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 837, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 662, "page_character_end": 411, "page_character_start": 328, "pdf_physical_page": 8, "printed_page": 8, "quote": "•       金利環境および日本の不動産市況の方向性の変化は織り込んでいない。\n\n                 •       M&A 活動は織り込んでいない。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 31198, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 31023, "source_character_end": 20884, "source_character_start": 20801, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-new-and-old-forecast-columns", "image_path": "images/page-8.png", "image_sha256": "4970438a2591260df14f18732c8daec14179bfcac9c53a196e0411cee1a4934b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 1135, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 853, "page_character_end": 649, "page_character_start": 427, "pdf_physical_page": 8, "printed_page": 8, "quote": "アストリスの業績予想\n               年度                    FY1/27E    FY1/28E    FY1/29E      FY1/27E      FY1/28E      FY1/29E\n                                        （旧）        （旧）        （旧）          （新）          （新）          （新）\n", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 31496, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 31214, "source_character_end": 21122, "source_character_start": 20900, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-forecast-NI-row-unit", "image_path": "images/page-8.png", "image_sha256": "4970438a2591260df14f18732c8daec14179bfcac9c53a196e0411cee1a4934b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 2018, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 1911, "page_character_end": 1446, "page_character_start": 1353, "pdf_physical_page": 8, "printed_page": 8, "quote": "当期純利益 (10 億円)             2.64       2.91       3.16           3.28         3.62         3.94", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 32379, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 32272, "source_character_end": 21919, "source_character_start": 21826, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-preconditions-market-expansion-and-2033", "image_path": "images/page-8.png", "image_sha256": "4970438a2591260df14f18732c8daec14179bfcac9c53a196e0411cee1a4934b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 3204, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 2753, "page_character_end": 2299, "page_character_start": 2080, "pdf_physical_page": 8, "printed_page": 8, "quote": "•       売上成長 – 当社では、分譲住宅の販売棟数の増加と持続的な平均販売単価の\n                         上昇が売上高の拡大を牽引すると考える。地域別では、2033 年までに売上高\n                         1,000 億円以上を目標とする「2033 年ビジョン」の下、首都圏エリアにおける成長\n                         が引き続き主要なカタリストとなる。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 33565, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 33114, "source_character_end": 22772, "source_character_start": 22553, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "author-profitability-expectation", "image_path": "images/page-8.png", "image_sha256": "4970438a2591260df14f18732c8daec14179bfcac9c53a196e0411cee1a4934b", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 3679, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 3223, "page_character_end": 2530, "page_character_start": 2318, "pdf_physical_page": 8, "printed_page": 8, "quote": "•       収益性 – 事業規模の拡大に伴う販管費効率の改善により、営業利益率は緩や\n                         かに拡大すると予想する。加えて、商品力およびブランドイメージ向上に伴う 1 棟\n                         あたりの販売単価の上昇と、より付加価値の高い住宅へのシフトの継続が、売上\n                         総利益率を下支えすると考える。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 34040, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 33584, "source_character_end": 23003, "source_character_start": 22791, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "creator-and-unverified-public-information", "image_path": "images/page-11.png", "image_sha256": "7d6a075f87cb151e6bceea8bea7ceffaf7e4372b1a8919c4620d7a3226303884", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 450, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 90, "page_character_end": 190, "page_character_start": 54, "pdf_physical_page": 11, "printed_page": 11, "quote": "本レポートは、アストリス・アドバイザリー・ジャパン株式会社が作成したものです。本レポートは、アストリス・アドバイザ\n           リー・ジャパン株式会社が信頼できると考える公開情報源から入手した情報に基づいていますが、独自検証は行ってお\n           らず", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 49814, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 49454, "source_character_end": 34965, "source_character_start": 34829, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}, {"id": "commission-and-payment", "image_path": "images/page-11.png", "image_sha256": "7d6a075f87cb151e6bceea8bea7ceffaf7e4372b1a8919c4620d7a3226303884", "offset_unit": "zero-based Unicode code points and UTF8 bytes in original saved pdftotext; end exclusive", "page_UTF8_byte_end": 2880, "page_UTF8_byte_start": 2664, "page_character_end": 1146, "page_character_start": 1060, "pdf_physical_page": 11, "printed_page": 11, "quote": "本レポートは、当該企業が委託して費用を負担したものであり、MiFID II で定義される許容可能な軽微な非金銭的利益\n           に該当すると判断されるものです。", "source_UTF8_byte_end": 52244, "source_UTF8_byte_start": 52028, "source_character_end": 35921, "source_character_start": 35835, "source_id": "case-public:cc1056ccbd3204206ab15aceab33c1b05c85f4dace3f235e12f454bd7169b328"}]
